Meeting summary for 22 January 2025:

  * *Closed: 2.6.x release*
    /2.6.13 was released last week./

  * *Updated: DCO Linux upstreaming*
    /Upstreaming DCO to Linux is proceeding, it is in review stage at
    the moment./
    /Patchset v18 sparked 2 discussions, both resolved. A v19 is
    expected to be sent in after net-next opens on February 3rd again./

  * *Updated: community.openvpn.net wiki*
    /it's online now, but completely empty. now we will look into a
    proper 404 page in preparation for the move.
    we are going to move releases information, IRC meeting summaries and
    notes, and security advisories over first. Then we'll see further./

As always you're welcome to join at #openvpn-meeting on Libera IRC 
network every Wednesday at 14:00 Central European Time.

Kind regards,
Johan Draaisma

